    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >'INTERSCAPE' is a dream-walking adventure that explores a world where dreams, memories, and the subconscious intertwine. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One day, a massive black sphere appears on Earth, trapping countless people in an endless dream from which they cannot wake. The protagonist ventures into the dangerous dream world within the sphere to save the people trapped inside. Players will explore a beautiful and surreal dream world, uncover hidden secrets, solve unique puzzles, and find a way to save humanity from eternal sleep. 'INTERSCAPE' explores the theme of dreams, offering players an immersive experience through impressive cinematics and storytelling. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ROOMTONE Games is focused on providing players with deep immersion and emotional experiences through video games.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >'INTERSCAPE' is a dream-walking adventure that explores a world where dreams, memories, and the subconscious intertwine. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One day, a massive black sphere appears on Earth, trapping countless people in an endless dream from which they cannot wake. The protagonist ventures into the dangerous dream world within the sphere to save the people trapped inside. Players will explore a beautiful and surreal dream world, uncover hidden secrets, solve unique puzzles, and find a way to save humanity from eternal sleep. 'INTERSCAPE' explores the theme of dreams, offering players an immersive experience through impressive cinematics and storytelling. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ROOMTONE Games is focused on providing players with deep immersion and emotional experiences through video games.</p>",
